  "text": "JMR. CO\n379B.\nIN REPLY PLEASE QUOTE\nPATRONS\nThe Hon. the Premier of N.S.W.\nThe Rt. Hon. the Lord Mayor of\nSydney.\nPRESIDENT\nThe Hon. the Minister for\nTransport.\nEXECUTIVE VICE-PRESIDENT\nSuperintendent of Motor\nTransport.\nSECRETARY\nJ. P.M. Reid Esq.\nC.H. McFadyen, Esq. C.B.E.,\nSecretary,\nCommonwealth Department of\nShipping and Transport,\n497 Collins Street,\nMELBOURNE.\nROAD SAFETY COUNCIL OF NEW SOUTH WALES\n99 Macquarie Street\nSydney\nTELEPHONE: B 0543\nTELEGRAMS: \" ROSAFE \"\nADDRESS ALL MAIL TO\nThe Secretary,\nRoad Safety Council of N.S.W.\nBox 28 G.P.O.\nSYDNEY.\n9 - JUN 1955\nDear Mr. McFadyen,\nIt was with considerable delight that I read your name\nin the honours list this morning.\nPlease\naccept my heartiest\ncongratulations. I am certain that the honour was well deserved.\nWith every best wish.\nYour sincerely,\nPREVENT ROAD ACCIDENTS-USE CARE, COURTESY AND COMMONSENSE ON THE ROADS\nSt. 857\nTHE MFARYER FAMILY\nTELOPER PARI\nCANBERRA\n1929",
